// Tag - granted/revoked by an upgrade (e.g. Heroes/Pixie/BirthdayCakeSkillAction). Read right after
// ProjectileSkillData spawns its projectile (see ProjectileSkillData.Fire), adding the existing
// Decoy tag onto the freshly spawned entity so it pulls enemy aggro for the rest of its flight
// (see Decoy.qtn/EnemyMovementUtility.TryFindNearestDecoy) - no new attraction mechanic needed, just
// reusing the one already there.
component DecoyOnThrowUpgrade
{
}
